@format 1
@id media-loading.in-convert-tab
@title In Convert tab
@section Media loading
@area In Convert tab
@entry convert-path-change
@summary Show only the Convert-specific step that bridges shared Files selection into shared viewer loading.
@related media-loading.common.files-intake, media-loading.common.files-selection, media-loading.common.viewer-gate
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag convert

@alias convert = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConvertTab

[convert-path-change] Convert Files current-path event <input>
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> convert-path-result

[convert-path-result] Convert selected-path adapter <decision>
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Convert viewer @ convert.PConvertPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:media-loading.common.viewer-gate
? "Blank current path" > convert-no-request

[convert-no-request] Convert viewer request omitted <output>
= Convert does not call the shared viewer-loading pipeline.
